{
  "dom_id": "step-t7977",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "A **conditional statement** (or **implication**) is a mathematical statement that takes the form \n\n$\\qquad$ *$P$ implies $Q,$* \n\nor equivalently, \n\n$\\qquad$ *if $P,$ then $Q.$*\n\nSymbolically, it can be written as $P \\Rightarrow Q,$ where $P$ is called the **antecedent** (or **hypothesis**) and $Q$ is called the **consequent** (or **conclusion**).\n\nThe truth table for $P \\Rightarrow Q$ is shown below.\n\n| $\\,P\\,$ | $\\,Q\\,$ | $\\, P \\Rightarrow Q \\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\textrm T$ | $\\textrm T$ | $\\color{black} \\textrm T$ |\n| $\\textrm T$ | $\\textrm F$ | $\\color{black} \\textrm F$ |\n| $\\textrm F$ | $\\textrm T$ | $\\color{black} \\textrm T$ |\n| $\\textrm F$ | $\\textrm F$ | $\\color{black} \\textrm T$ |\n\nIntuitively, an implication can be viewed as a \"promise\" that whenever $P$ is true, $Q$ is also true. The implication is true unless the promise is broken, i.e., $P$ is true, and $Q$ is false. \n\nWe'll discuss the intuition behind implications in more detail later in the lesson.",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t7977\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Introduction</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t7977\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>A <strong>conditional statement</strong> (or <strong>implication</strong>) is a mathematical statement that takes the form </p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"4.645ex\" height=\"0.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.171ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -73.8 2000 147.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\qquad</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\"></defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></g>\n</svg></span> <em><span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.745ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 751.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">P</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> implies <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.485ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1070 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">Q,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-51\" d=\"M399 -80Q399 -47 400 -30T402 -11V-7L387 -11Q341 -22 303 -22Q208 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435Q740 255 592 107Q529 47 461 16L444 8V3Q444 2 449 -24T470 -66T516 -82Q551 -82 583 -60T625 -3Q631 11 638 11Q647 11 649 2Q649 -6 639 -34T611 -100T557 -165T481 -194Q399 -194 399 -87V-80ZM636 468Q636 523 621 564T580 625T530 655T477 665Q429 665 379 640Q277 591 215 464T153 216Q153 110 207 59Q231 38 236 38V46Q236 86 269 120T347 155Q372 155 390 144T417 114T429 82T435 55L448 64Q512 108 557 185T619 334T636 468ZM314 18Q362 18 404 39L403 49Q399 104 366 115Q354 117 347 117Q344 117 341 117T337 118Q317 118 296 98T274 52Q274 18 314 18Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-51\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"791\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></em> </p>\n<p>or equivalently, </p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"4.645ex\" height=\"0.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.171ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -73.8 2000 147.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\qquad</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\"></defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></g>\n</svg></span> <em>if <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.392ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1030 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">P,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"751\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> then <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.485ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1070 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">Q.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMATHI-51\" d=\"M399 -80Q399 -47 400 -30T402 -11V-7L387 -11Q341 -22 303 -22Q208 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435Q740 255 592 107Q529 47 461 16L444 8V3Q444 2 449 -24T470 -66T516 -82Q551 -82 583 -60T625 -3Q631 11 638 11Q647 11 649 2Q649 -6 639 -34T611 -100T557 -165T481 -194Q399 -194 399 -87V-80ZM636 468Q636 523 621 564T580 625T530 655T477 665Q429 665 379 640Q277 591 215 464T153 216Q153 110 207 59Q231 38 236 38V46Q236 86 269 120T347 155Q372 155 390 144T417 114T429 82T435 55L448 64Q512 108 557 185T619 334T636 468ZM314 18Q362 18 404 39L403 49Q399 104 366 115Q354 117 347 117Q344 117 341 117T337 118Q317 118 296 98T274 52Q274 18 314 18Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-51\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"791\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></em></p>\n<p>Symbolically, it can be written as <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"7.845ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 3377.6 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">P \\Rightarrow Q,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-21D2\" d=\"M580 514Q580 525 596 525Q601 525 604 525T609 525T613 524T615 523T617 520T619 517T622 512Q659 438 720 381T831 300T927 263Q944 258 944 250T935 239T898 228T840 204Q696 134 622 -12Q618 -21 615 -22T600 -24Q580 -24 580 -17Q580 -13 585 0Q620 69 671 123L681 133H70Q56 140 56 153Q56 168 72 173H725L735 181Q774 211 852 250Q851 251 834 259T789 283T735 319L725 327H72Q56 332 56 347Q56 360 70 367H681L671 377Q638 412 609 458T580 514Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMATHI-51\" d=\"M399 -80Q399 -47 400 -30T402 -11V-7L387 -11Q341 -22 303 -22Q208 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435Q740 255 592 107Q529 47 461 16L444 8V3Q444 2 449 -24T470 -66T516 -82Q551 -82 583 -60T625 -3Q631 11 638 11Q647 11 649 2Q649 -6 639 -34T611 -100T557 -165T481 -194Q399 -194 399 -87V-80ZM636 468Q636 523 621 564T580 625T530 655T477 665Q429 665 379 640Q277 591 215 464T153 216Q153 110 207 59Q231 38 236 38V46Q236 86 269 120T347 155Q372 155 390 144T417 114T429 82T435 55L448 64Q512 108 557 185T619 334T636 468ZM314 18Q362 18 404 39L403 49Q399 104 366 115Q354 117 347 117Q344 117 341 117T337 118Q317 118 296 98T274 52Q274 18 314 18Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-21D2\" x=\"1029\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMATHI-51\" x=\"2307\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"3099\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> where <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.745ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 751.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">P</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is called the <strong>antecedent</strong> (or <strong>hypothesis</strong>) and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.838ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 791.5 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-9-Title\">Q</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E9-MJMATHI-51\" d=\"M399 -80Q399 -47 400 -30T402 -11V-7L387 -11Q341 -22 303 -22Q208 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435Q740 255 592 107Q529 47 461 16L444 8V3Q444 2 449 -24T470 -66T516 -82Q551 -82 583 -60T625 -3Q631 11 638 11Q647 11 649 2Q649 -6 639 -34T611 -100T557 -165T481 -194Q399 -194 399 -87V-80ZM636 468Q636 523 621 564T580 625T530 655T477 665Q429 665 379 640Q277 591 215 464T153 216Q153 1